00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.960
Let me tell you something

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.960
Many years ago

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.960
My mom was a taxi driver

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:11.000
One day after work, she was rushing to return the car

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.680
She suddenly saw a couple on the road

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.760
The woman was pregnant

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.200
She held her belly, looking pale

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.320
She seemed about to give birth

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:22.080
Other drivers were afraid of trouble

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.360
No one wanted to pick them up

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.240
Only my mom let them in her car

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.400
She sped all the way to the hospital

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.560
She even drove on the non-motor vehicle lane

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.520
The man said on the way

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.640
Don't drive like this

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.320
You'll get fined for driving like this

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.680
My mom said she didn't care

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.200
And then

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:44.000
She got the couple to the hospital safely

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.800
Your mom is a good person

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:49.480
Yeah

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.520
Did she pay the fine later?

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.560
Of course she did

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.840
Brother, why do you focus on such odd things?

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.280
So

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.680
That couple was my parents

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.000
So, shouldn't you thank my mom?

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.360
Without her

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.360
You might not have been born safely

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.400
The beginning of a story

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.240
Is often beautiful

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.080
Just like your birth

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.240
Just like my mom meeting your parents

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.960
But the ending

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.640
Always surprises people

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:51.560
Your mom passed away

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:53.840
And my mom

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.360
Years later, she ended up with your dad

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.800
No one could have imagined this ending

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.360
But I always feel

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:04.520
Those

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.320
Beautiful beginnings

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.320
Those memories are beautiful

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.080
That's enough

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.680
Beautiful memories

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:31.560
That's enough

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.200
That's enough

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.720
The story I just told

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.240
Happened on this day years ago

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.760
My parents chose to marry yesterday

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:51.280
So that the day after

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.200
Our family could celebrate your birthday together

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.720
Even though it didn't go smoothly

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:56.520
But that's okay

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:57.840
I'm here on their behalf

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:00.880
Brother

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.080
Happy birthday

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.440
I know today is my birthday

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:07.840
I just didn't expect

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.040
Anything worth celebrating

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:16.960
Driver, stop the car

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.000
I have to go now

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.120
Thank you for celebrating my birthday

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.320
Brother

